type: software
abstract: >-
  Spectral Analyzer Pro is a desktop application for chemometrics and QSAR
  analysis of spectral data. It supports preprocessing, collinearity reduction,
  leak-free cross-validation, multiple regression models, Golbraikh-Tropsha
  criteria, SHAP explanations, and Excel report export.
